* cics-crucible condition-handling / hc-file-read-set
DEFINE PROGRAM(HCRDST) GROUP(CRUCHC) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(HC83) GROUP(CRUCHC) PROGRAM(HCRDST)
* the file the case reads and browses: a local VSAM KSDS, seeded from data/HCRS.dat, opened on first use
DEFINE FILE(HCRS) GROUP(CRUCHC) DSNAME(CRUCIBLE.HC.RFILE)
       STATUS(ENABLED) OPENTIME(FIRSTREF) ADD(NO)
       BROWSE(YES) DELETE(NO) READ(YES) UPDATE(NO)
* T001 accepts automatic transaction initiation (START TERMID): SPEC section 2
DEFINE TYPETERM(CRU3278) GROUP(CRUCHC) DEVICE(3270) TERMMODEL(2)
       ATI(YES) TTI(YES)
DEFINE TERMINAL(T001) GROUP(CRUCHC) TYPETERM(CRU3278)
